      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "Unlike a [`StateObject`](stateobject.md) which manages data storage, you use an observed object to refer to storage that you manage elsewhere, as in the following example:",
      "normalizedSource": "Unlike a [`StateObject`](stateobject.md) which manages data storage, you use an observed object to refer to storage that you manage elsewhere, as in the following example:",
