      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Instead, declare an input to a view with the `@ObservedObject` attribute, and pass a value to this input when you instantiate the view.",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\nclass DataModel: ObservableObject {\n    @Published var name = \"Some Name\"\n    @Published var isEnabled = false\n}\n\nstruct MyView: View {\n    @StateObject private var model = DataModel()\n\n    var body: some View {\n        Text(model.name)\n        MySubView(model: model)\n    }\n}\n\nstruct MySubView: View {\n    @ObservedObject var model: DataModel\n\n    var body: some View {\n        Toggle(\"Enabled\", isOn: $model.isEnabled)\n    }\n}\n```",
